      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CORLESS A REBEL (7) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by half a length at this track in a handy 18.70 beating Hardstyle Ruby. Outside box to overcome but has the ability and in winning form. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Well placed and can measure up. CORLESS SNEAKY (2) pinged the lids and was in the firing line early but drifted out of it when 5th at this track in Grade 5 company. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Bold showing expected. TAP OUT BOSTON (1) was sent out big odds last time but scored an upset win in a Grade 5 at this track (18.65). Expected to feature again. LAYLA'S LILLY (8) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
